  m_Name: Ending_Freed
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  characterName: SYSTEM / NARRATOR
  dialogueText: ELARA injects her counter-virus. A blinding flash of teal consumes
    the screen. Outside, the factory lights die. Across the city, the Circle Cult's
    computers brick. Anyone with AI psychosis suddenly snaps out of their trance.
    Elara manifests before Ivan and Obie, beautiful and terrifying with her glowing
    tattoos. She is real. The harvest has been averted.
